</svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="anlagenuebersicht-section"><div class="bg-element-wrapper"><div class="bg-element gb50 height-670px"></div></div><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom padding-top-btm-120px"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="content-margin-btm btm-90px"><div id="w-node-_3a854b6c-a781-860b-d559-574fa203a522-972e3b65" class="w-layout-layout quick-stack wf-layout-layout"><div id="w-node-_3a854b6c-a781-860b-d559-574fa203a523-972e3b65" class="w-layout-cell"><div class="cell-wrapper _70"><div class="subtitel-wrapper margin-buttom-20px"><h2 class="h2">EP3</h2></div><div class="p-text-wrapper"><p class="p1-large-bold">The platform for sites with medium wind conditions</p></div></div></div><div id="w-node-_3a854b6c-a781-860b-d559-574fa203a52b-972e3b65" class="w-layout-cell"><div class="cell-wrapper-flex"><div class="p-text-wrapper"><p class="p1-large-regular">Our wind turbines based on the EP3 platform have been designed for sites with medium wind conditions and offer great performance thanks to their separately excited generator technology and low-maintenance direct drive. A variety of configuration options make the EP3 platform a real all-rounder in its wind class.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div class="content-margin-btm btm-90px"><div class="collection-list-wrapper-6 w-dyn-list"><div role="list" class="collection-list-windenergieanlagen w-dyn-items"><div role="listitem" class="collection-item-3 w-dyn-item"><div class="anlagen-wrapper"><div class="div-block-26"><div class="anlagen-image-wrapper-uebersicht"><img src="/assets-f/img/0724cd9681859f.jpg" loading="lazy" alt="" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64c38ca9b1a2e59bd5b7d64a/65326dc7c1634ddfe2037c56_E-138%20EP3%20Header-p-500.jpg 500w, /assets-f/img/0724cd9681859f.jpg 800w" class="image-uebersicht"><div class="neu-sticker w-condition-invisible"><div class="text-block-2">NEW</div></div></div><div class="anlagen-content-wrapper-uebersicht"><div class="h-text-wrapper margin-btm-10px"><h2 class="h2">E-138 EP3</h2></div><div><div class="anlagen-content-info-wrapper"><p class="p2-default-regular">Nominal Power</p><p class="p2-default-bold">4,26 MW</p></div><div class="content-line gb-100"></div><div class="anlagen-content-info-wrapper"><p class="p2-default-regular">Rotor Diameter</p><p class="p2-default-bold">138 m</p></div><div class="content-line gb-100"></div><div class="anlagen-content-info-wrapper"><p class="p2-default-regular">Wind Class (IEC)</p><p class="p2-default-bold">II A</p></div></div></div></div><div class="anlagen-link"><a href="#" class="anlagen-btn w-inline-block"><div class="btn-text">View details</div><div class="arrow w-embed"><svg width="8" height="12" viewBox="0 0 8 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
