</svg></div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section-benefits green"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom top-btm-120"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="section-headline-wrapper padd-side-normal mar-btm-80"><h2 class="h2 white">Our Customer Promise</h2></div><div class="cta-icon-grid-wrapper"><div class="w-layout-grid cta-icon-grid _6-colums"><div id="w-node-aec8f3f9-b21f-636a-ce51-3632043a1c39-972e3b65" class="cta-icon-content horizontal"><div class="cta-icon-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/35323b4daa04b7.svg" loading="lazy" alt="" height="50" class="cta-icon"></div><div class="cta-icon-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3 white">Quality</h3><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">We supply high-quality products and innovative solutions.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-_24ee8679-cfe7-1075-cd13-1e8d11403c15-972e3b65" class="cta-icon-content horizontal"><div class="cta-icon-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/0d1c92db4f675b.svg" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" alt="" class="cta-icon"></div><div class="cta-icon-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3 white">Partnering</h3><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">We support you as partners throughout your project.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-c9d7ebb1-8c5e-4039-1716-db28be2e4ae4-972e3b65" class="cta-icon-content horizontal"><div class="cta-icon-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/dcd2f5cd0b7382.svg" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" alt="" class="cta-icon"></div><div class="cta-icon-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3 white"><strong>Reliability</strong></h3><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">We communicate transparently and are happy to be judged on our actions.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-e70847bb-4bf8-9513-323b-82198fbe5c93-972e3b65" class="cta-icon-content horizontal"><div class="cta-icon-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/265b72195c67ad.svg" loading="lazy" width="Auto" height="50" alt="" class="cta-icon"></div><div class="cta-icon-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3 white">Flexibility</h3><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">We stay agile and adapt to changing boundary conditions.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-b9d6236c-9359-3d80-1df9-29013aa6312f-972e3b65" class="cta-icon-content horizontal"><div class="cta-icon-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/c8398638268b8b.svg" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" alt="" class="cta-icon"></div><div class="cta-icon-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3 white">Responsibility</h3><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">We assume responsibility for the tasks assigned to us.</p></div></div><div id="w-node-f355e046-ca52-f7e6-6830-afb69a770e14-972e3b65" class="cta-icon-content horizontal"><div class="cta-icon-wrapper"><img src="/assets-f/img/5da0505a83fa86.svg" loading="lazy" width="50" height="50" alt="" class="cta-icon"></div><div class="cta-icon-text-wrapper"><h3 class="h3 white">Respect</h3><p class="p1-large-regular gb-200">We treat one another with respect, as this is the basis for successful working relationships.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="enercon-ueberblick-section"><div class="padding-side normal"><div class="padding-top-bottom padding-top-btm-120px"><div class="w-layout-blockcontainer main-container w-container"><div class="section-headline-wrapper padd-side-normal mar-btm-80"><h2 class="h2">Further Information about the Company</h2></div><div class="w-layout-grid grid-weitere-inhalte"><div id="w-node-_87d0b175-9f02-2446-1bd6-09e8a95dae45-972e3b65" class="card-link-info"><div class="link-info-image-box"><img src="/assets-f/img/019557c5fab9c6.webp" loading="lazy" alt="ENERCON Features: Vereiste technische Komponenten im Wintereinsatz, individuelle Ausstattung und Konfiguration" class="image-link-info"></div><div class="content-link-info"><div class="text-link-info"><h3 class="h3">Features</h3><p class="p1-large-regular">Further details of features and customised technology configurations.</p></div><a href="#" class="info-link-block w-inline-block"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View details</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_87d0b175-9f02-2446-1bd6-09e8a95dae52-972e3b65" class="card-link-info"><div class="link-info-image-box"><img src="/assets-f/img/5772c57f2347ed.webp" loading="lazy" alt="Innenansicht einer ENERCON Windenergieanlage: Techniker arbeitet an moderner Anlagentechnologie für hohe Leistung" class="image-link-info"></div><div class="content-link-info"><div class="text-link-info"><h3 class="h3">ENERCON technology</h3><p class="p1-large-regular">Benefits of ENERCON’s powerful wind turbine technology.</p></div><a href="#" class="info-link-block w-inline-block"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View details</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></div><div id="w-node-_87d0b175-9f02-2446-1bd6-09e8a95dae5f-972e3b65" class="card-link-info"><div class="link-info-image-box"><img src="/assets-f/img/f025e76326f890.webp" loading="lazy" sizes="100vw" srcset="https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6536477e5a4665de620e5e19_Showroom-p-500.webp 500w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6536477e5a4665de620e5e19_Showroom-p-800.webp 800w, https://cdn.prod.website-files.com/64b8eae3d93f0e1149760740/6536477e5a4665de620e5e19_Showroom-p-1080.webp 1080w, /assets-f/img/f025e76326f890.webp 1600w" alt="ENERCON Showroom: Interaktive Präsentation aller Produkte und Services, 24/7 digital verfügbar" class="image-link-info"></div><div class="content-link-info"><div class="text-link-info"><h3 class="h3">ENERCON&nbsp;Showroom</h3><p class="p1-large-regular">All products and services at a glance – available 24/7 in an interactive format.</p></div><a href="https://showroom.enercon.de/en/" target="_blank" class="info-link-block w-inline-block"><p class="p1-large-bold gb-500">View details</p><img src="/assets-f/img/97d7d840b4ac55.svg" loading="lazy" alt=""></a></div></d